msgstr "Hi,<br><br>Glad to hear that you have decided to help us, thank you so much!<br><br>As currently we are putting the finishing touches, I will let you know as soon as the service is launched and will give you the step-by-step instructions on what to do.<br><br>Let's keep in touch!"

