#: application/views/private_messages/hellomessage/photographer_old.phtml:2
#, php-format
msgid "Please kindly note some important things about the MyWed account:\n"
"MyWed accounts are personal ones. Only real name and surname in the Name and Surname fields are accepted by our editors.\n\n"
"Confirm your phone number: %1$s in order to send messages, Like photos and stories, share comments and create topics.\n\n"
"Please read carefully our requirements: %2$s before uploading images to your portfolio.\n\n"
"Upload %3$s photos and %4$s wedding story (series of photos taken at one wedding) to your portfolio.\n\n"
"After that our editors will be able to review your account. Your profile will not be visible to anyone except our editors until it is approved.\n\n"
"The approval process can take up to 3 business days. Please be patient.\n\n"
"If everything is ok you will receive the message about your profile approval. If something is wrong you will receive a message with instructions to follow.\n\n"
"Wonder how to promote your portfolio on the website?\n\n"
"The Interview tab in your profile: %5$s allows you to create an interview text on your personal page.\n"
"Please answer the questions in your national language to make it visible in the catalogue of local photographers searched by city or country.\n\n"
"Please feel free to contact us in case you have any questions."
msgstr "敬請留意MyWed帳戶的重要事項：\n"
"MyWed帳戶為個人使用。我們的編輯僅接受在姓名欄位中填寫真實姓名的申請。\n\n"
"請確認您的電話號碼：%1$s 以便寄送訊息、對照片和故事按讚、分享留言以及建立主題。\n\n"
"在上傳圖像至您的作品集前，請仔細閱讀我們的要求：%2$s \n\n"
"請上傳%3$s張照片與%4$s則婚禮故事（在同場婚禮中拍攝的照片系列）至您的作品集。\n\n"
"在那之後，我們的編輯將會審視您的帳戶。您的個人檔案在核准之前不會對任何其他人開放。\n\n"
"審核過程可能會長達三個工作天。請耐心等候。\n\n"
"如果一切正常，您會收到關於個人檔案核准的訊息。如果有任何錯誤，您將會收到應遵循指示的訊息。\n\n"
"想知道要如何在網站上推廣您的作品集？\n\n"
"您個人檔案中的面試分頁：%5$s 能夠讓您在個人頁面上建立面試文字內容。\n"
"請使用您的國家語言回答問題，以便顯示於以城市或國家為搜尋條件的當地攝影師名錄上。\n\n"
"若有任何問題，請隨時與我們聯繫。"

#: application/views/private_messages/hellomessage/videographer.phtml:6
#: application/views/scripts/translations/videographers.phtml:274
#, php-format
msgid "Confirm your phone number: %s in order to send messages, Like photos, stories and videos, share comments and create topics."
msgstr "請確認您的電話號碼：%s 以便寄送訊息，對照片、故事與影片按讚，分享留言以及新增主題。"

#: application/views/private_messages/hellomessage/videographer.phtml:8
#: application/views/scripts/translations/videographers.phtml:293
#, php-format
msgid "Please read carefully our requirements: %1$s before adding videos to your portfolio.\n\n"
"Remember to add %2$s videos to your portfolio."
msgstr "在新增影片至作品集前，請仔細閱讀我們的要求：%1$s。\n\n"
"請記得要新增%2$s支影片到您的作品集。"

#: application/views/private_messages/hellomessage/videographer.phtml:12
#: application/views/scripts/translations/videographers.phtml:280
#, php-format
msgid "After that our editors will be able to review your account. Your profile will not be visible to anyone except our editors until it is approved.\n\n"
"The approval process can take up to 3 business days. Please be patient.\n\n"
"If everything is ok you will receive the message about your profile approval. If something is wrong you will receive a message with instructions to follow.\n\n\n"
"Wonder how to promote your portfolio on the website?\n\n"
"The Interview tab in your profile: %s allows you to create an interview text on your personal page."
msgstr "在那之後，我們的編輯將會審視您的帳戶。您的個人檔案在核准之前不會對任何其他人開放。\n\n"
"審核過程可能會長達三個工作天。請耐心等候。\n\n"
"如果一切正常，您會收到關於個人檔案核准的訊息。如果有任何錯誤，您將會收到應遵循指示的訊息。\n\n\n"
"想知道要如何在網站上推廣您的作品集？\n\n"
"您個人檔案中的面試分頁：%s 能夠讓您在個人頁面上建立面試文字內容。"

#: application/views/private_messages/hellomessage/videographer.phtml:22
#: application/views/scripts/translations/videographers.phtml:297
msgid "Please answer the questions in your national language to make it visible in the catalogue of local videographers searched by city or country."
msgstr "請使用您的國家語言回答問題，以便顯示於以城市或國家為搜尋條件的當地錄影師名錄上。"

#: application/views/private_messages/launching_packages.phtml:2
#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:1274
msgid "MyWed enables a new feature of specifying the price for a few hours of your work, instead of the only hourly rate. It is a more precise and fair approach, since a photographer's work may significantly vary depending on the number of hours ordered."
msgstr "MyWed啟用了一項新功能，您可以指明多個小時工作的價格，而不只是時薪。這是個更加精確且公平的方法，因為攝影師的作業可能會因為預訂時數的不同而產生重大差異。"

#: application/views/private_messages/launching_packages.phtml:4
#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:1276
msgid "For the Wedding category, you can select any three of the six options: 1, 2, 3, 6, 9, and 12 hours."
msgstr "在婚禮類別中，您可以從以下六個選項中任選三項：1、2、3、6、8以及10小時。"

#: application/views/private_messages/launching_packages.phtml:6
#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:1278
msgid "Other categories include packages for 1, 2, or 3 hours only."
msgstr "其他類別只有1、2、3或6小時的方案。"

#: application/views/private_messages/launching_packages.phtml:8
#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:1280
#, php-format
msgid "To apply the new system, click the Specify your rates button in your <a href=\"%1$s\" %2$s>profile</a>, and set prices for the packages on the pop-up. Don't forget to update prices for all active categories."
msgstr "若要套用新系統，請點擊<a href=\"%1$s\" %2$s>個人檔案</a>中的「指明收費」按鈕，並在彈窗中設定方案價格。請別忘了為所有啟用中的類別更新價格。"

#: application/views/private_messages/launching_packages.phtml:12
#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:1282
msgid "We will fully implement the system, so we'll be grateful if you update your rates as soon as possible. Thank you!"
msgstr "系統即將全面實施，因此若您能夠盡快更新收費，我們將感激不盡。謝謝您！"

#: application/views/private_messages/merge_photo_series.phtml:3
#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:553
#, php-format
msgid "Today we merge the photos and series feed - %s so there is no need to switch between the sections anymore."
msgstr "我們現在已經把照片和系列資訊牆合併了——%s 因此您再也不必在區塊之間切換。"

#: application/views/private_messages/merge_photo_series.phtml:4
#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:555
#, php-format
msgid "On your profile page %s series are also combined with photos. This allowed us to get rid of the \"Photos Weddings Photo shoots Interview\" submenu and made the navigation easier. You can change the order of series and photos in your portfolio by simply dragging and dropping them."
msgstr "在您的個人資料頁面 %s 上，系列也與照片結合了。這讓我們能夠移除「照片婚禮拍攝面試」子選單，並且使導航更加輕鬆。您可以在作品集中透過拖拉動作變更系列和照片的順序。"

#: application/views/private_messages/merge_photo_series.phtml:6
#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:559
#, php-format
msgid "Photo shoots will no longer be displayed in the profile, but you can always find them in the \"My topics\" section of the forum: %s"
msgstr "個人資料將不再顯示照片拍攝，但是您可以隨時在論壇的「我的主題」區塊中找到他們：%s"

#: application/views/private_messages/merge_photo_series.phtml:7
#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:561
#, php-format
msgid "If necessary, you can quickly save a photo shoot to your computer (using the Download button inside the topic) and reupload it to the appropriate category of your portfolio (%s)."
msgstr "如有需要，您可以迅速將照片拍攝儲存至電腦（使用主題內的下載按鈕）並重新上傳到作品集中合適的類別（%s）裡。"

#: application/views/private_messages/merge_photo_series.phtml:9
#: application/views/private_messages/notifications.phtml:4
#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:565
#, php-format
msgid "You can find out more details and ask a question in the forum topic: %s"
msgstr "您可以在此論壇主題中了解更多細節和詢問問題：%s"

