#: application/views/private_messages/need_photo.phtml:1
#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:375
msgid "We noticed that you haven't posted any photos on MyWed lately :(\n\n"
"It's quite important for us to maintain the photographers' directory relevant. Please upload at least one photo to let us know you are still into keeping your profile.\n\n"
"We'll be eagerly waiting for that!"
msgstr "我們注意到您最近沒有在MyWed上發佈任何照片 :(\n\n"
"保持攝影師名錄的相關性對我們來說相當重要。請至少上傳一張照片，讓我們知道您仍然想保留您的個人檔案。\n\n"
"我們將熱切等待！"

