#, php-format
msgid "Winter Holidays offer: get a %1$s discount on MyWed Pro!\n\n"
"The offer is valid from December %2$s till January %3$s. Take advantage of the discount here: %4$s\n\n"
"The promotion is available for the message recipients only."
msgstr "寒假優惠：MyWed Pro方案減價%1$s！\n\n"
