"此促銷僅限訊息收信人使用。"

#: application/views/private_messages/newbie_pro.phtml:1
#, php-format
msgid "Do you wish to get your MyWed portfolio a higher position in the directory? Or to upload more photos and stories?\n\n"
"Exclusively for newbies, we have a special offer for the purchase of the Pro account.\n"
"Seize the opportunity of a %1$s discount and become a Pro member for %2$s only! The offer is valid until %3$s.\n\n"
"Got interested? The discount is already applied, just go to the subscription page: %4$s and jump at the chance of reaching the top!"
msgstr "您希望您的MyWed作品集在名錄上取得更高的位置嗎？或是想上傳更多的照片和故事？\n\n"
"新手限定，我們提供了購買Pro帳號的特別優惠。\n"
"抓住折扣%1$s的機會，並且只花%2$s即成為Pro會員！此優惠有效期限至%3$s。\n\n"
"有興趣？優惠已發送，您只需要前往訂閱頁面：%4$s 就能抓住到達頂端的機會！"

#: application/views/private_messages/notifications.phtml:3
msgid "We have updated the website to show notifications so that you don't miss anything. Pushing the bell icon in the main menu, you will find notifications of new likes, comments and followers."
msgstr "我們已更新網站的通知顯示功能，因此您不會錯過任何事。按下主選單的鈴鐺圖示，您就可以找到新版的按讚、留言和粉絲通知。"

#: application/views/private_messages/rating-boost.phtml:2
msgid "Unfortunately, your website link was not approved by our moderators.\n\n"
"Please consider the rejection reason:"
msgstr "很遺憾，您的網站連結並未取得我們審核人員的核准。\n\n"
"請參考拒絕理由："

#: application/views/private_messages/rating-boost.phtml:8
#, php-format
