msgstr "您可以在%1$s之前免費繳交參賽照片到專用頁面上：%2$s"

#: application/views/private_messages/second_after_register.phtml:1
#, php-format
msgid "It's nice to have you among the members of our community! How are your first days on MyWed?\n\n"
"After having set up your account you might have started wondering how to increase your rating. And, luckily, there is a way to do that by simply placing our logo on your website. Learn more about it here: %s\n\n"
"By the way, logos, as well as embed codes for them, can be found on this page: %s\n\n"
"Don't hesitate to contact us if you have any questions."
msgstr "很高興您能成為我們社群的一員！在MyWed的前幾天過得怎麼樣呢？\n\n"
"在設定完帳戶之後，您可能會想知道該如何提升您的評級。幸運的是，您只需要在自己的網站上放入我們的圖標就行了。在這裡了解更多資訊：%s\n\n"
"另外，圖標以及內嵌碼能夠在此頁面上找到：%s\n\n"
"如果有任何疑問，請不要猶豫聯繫我們。"

#: application/views/private_messages/set_about_languages.phtml:8
#: application/views/private_messages/set_about_languages2.phtml:5
#: application/views/scripts/photographer/_edit-button-for-admin-new.phtml:3
#: application/views/scripts/photographer/_new_block_profile.phtml:369
#: application/views/scripts/photographer/_new_block_profile.phtml:387
#: application/views/scripts/photographer/components/_profile-content-head.phtml:269
#: application/views/scripts/photographer/components/_profile-content-head.phtml:273
#: application/views/scripts/photographer/components/_profile-head.phtml:110
#: application/views/scripts/photographer/components/_profile-head.phtml:114
msgid "Edit the description"
msgstr "編輯說明"

#: application/views/private_messages/set_about_languages.phtml:8
#: application/views/private_messages/set_about_languages2.phtml:5
#, php-format
msgid "To do that, open your profile page: %1$s and click on the '%2$s' button."
msgstr "為此，請開啟您的個人檔案頁面：%1$s 並點擊「%2$s」按鈕。"

#: application/views/private_messages/set_about_on_country_language.phtml:1
#, php-format
msgid "Hi %s,\n\n"
"Kindly be aware that you haven't specified a text about you in your national language (%s) in your profile.\n\n"
"Please create a profile description text in your national language so that a couple from your country could read the information about you."
msgstr "您好%s，\n\n"
"請留意您尚未在個人檔案中以國家語言（%s）指定關於您的文字。\n\n"
"請以國家語言建立個人檔案說明文字，讓來自您國家的新人能夠閱讀關於您的資訊。"

#: application/views/private_messages/set_phone.phtml:2
msgid "We have noticed that you didn’t set your phone number to the profile. It is really important to set it because 9 of 10 couples prefer contacting photographers by phone."
msgstr "我們注意到您並未在個人檔案中留下電話號碼。設定電話號碼非常重要，因為有九成的新人會想以電話聯繫攝影師。"

#: application/views/private_messages/set_phone.phtml:4
msgid "The phone number is also required to confirm your profile is not fake. The setting of the phone number proves your identity and makes our community more safe."
msgstr "電話號碼同時也用來確認您的個人檔案並不是假的。設定電話號碼能夠證明您的身分，並讓我們的社群更加安全。"

#: application/views/private_messages/set_phone.phtml:6
msgid "You will also be able to use the phone number to reset your password in case you lose access to your email."
msgstr "在無法取得電子郵件時，您還可以使用電話號碼重設密碼。"

#: application/views/private_messages/set_phone.phtml:8
msgid "In other words, the phone number is absolutely necessary to use all MyWed features."
msgstr "換句話說，想要使用MyWed的所有功能，電話號碼絕對是必要的。"

#: application/views/private_messages/set_valid_email.phtml:1
#, php-format
msgid "Hi %1$s,\n\n"
"We have noticed that emails that we send to %2$s bounce back to us. Please set your valid email in the settings of your personal profile: %3$s\n\n"
"Otherwise, your MyWed account might be removed."
msgstr "您好，%1$s，\n\n"
"我們注意到寄送至%2$s的電子郵件返回傳送給我們。請在個人檔案的設定中輸入您的有效電子郵件：%3$s\n\n"
"否則您的MyWed帳戶有可能會被移除。"

#: application/views/private_messages/tags.phtml:10
#, php-format
msgid "Learn the details in this forum topic: %s"
msgstr "請查看這個論壇主題了解細節：%s"

#: application/views/private_messages/unavailable_email.phtml:1
#, php-format
msgid "Hi %s,\n\n"
"We have noticed that the emails we send to you are returned. Probably, the email address set in your profile is no longer active or incorrect.\n\n"
"Please check and provide the necessary updates."
msgstr "您好，%s，\n\n"
"我們發現寄送給您的電子郵件被退回。這可能是因為您在個人檔案中設定的電子郵件不再有效或不正確。\n\n"
"請檢查並提供必要的更新。"

#: application/views/private_messages/wake_up.phtml:1
msgid "Your profile isn't shown in the catalogue."
msgstr "您的個人檔案並未顯示在名錄中。"

#: application/views/private_messages/wake_up.phtml:3
