#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:7
msgid "How to become a member?"
msgstr "如何成為會員？"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:8
#, php-format
msgid "Set your real name, surname, and phone number. Choose one of the categories (%1$s), and set your rates. Upload precisely %2$s photos corresponding to the chosen category (you will be able to unlock more categories later). After that, your profile will be automatically submitted for approval by our moderators. Usually, it takes a couple of days."
msgstr "設定您的真實姓名與電話號碼。選擇一個類別（%1$s）並設定價格。精確上傳 %2$s 張與所選類別相對應的照片（您能夠在稍後解鎖更多類別）。之後，您的個人檔案將會自動繳交給審核人員進行核准作業。這通常需要幾天時間。"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:9
msgid "Is joining MyWed free?"
msgstr "加入MyWed是免費的嗎？"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:10
#: application/views/scripts/translations/category.phtml:199
msgid "It's absolutely free and will always be."
msgstr "這完全免費，且永遠如此。"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:11
msgid "Can I have several accounts?"
msgstr "我可以擁有多個帳戶嗎？"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:12
msgid "Nope. You can have only one account."
msgstr "不可以。您只能擁有一個帳戶。"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:13
msgid "Can I use the studio name in my profile?"
msgstr "我能在個人檔案中使用工作室名稱嗎？"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:14
msgid "Please use your real name. People who see your beautiful photos want to know who's made them. <br> There’s no need to hide behind the alias."
msgstr "請使用您的真實姓名。看到您美圖的人會想知道攝影師是誰。<br>沒有必要使用別名。"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:15
#: application/views/scripts/translations/category.phtml:200
msgid "What resolution should the photos be?"
msgstr "照片解析度為何？"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:16
#, php-format
msgid "Do you enjoy checking out beautiful shots in high quality? So do we! Please upload photos with a resolution of at least %s pixels on the long side to make them look fine even on big displays."
msgstr "您喜愛欣賞高畫質的漂亮照片嗎？我們也是！請上傳長邊至少擁有 %s 像素解析度的照片，以便在大型屏幕上也能亮麗展示。"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:17
#: application/views/scripts/translations/category.phtml:201
msgid "How many photos can I upload?"
msgstr "我可以上傳多少張照片？"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:18
#, php-format
msgid "When joining MyWed, you can upload %1$s photos, and then – %2$s photos per week. You can extend the limit up to %3$s photos per week by purchasing the MyWed Pro account. The total amount of photos in the portfolio is unlimited."
msgstr "加入MyWed時，您可以上傳%1$s張照片，接下來——每週%2$s張。透過購買MyWed Pro帳戶，您可以將限制提高到每週%3$s張照片。"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:19
msgid "Do you have any approval process for photographers and photos?"
msgstr "對於攝影師和照片是否有審核過程？"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:20
msgid "Yes, we do. All new photographers are subject to moderation (usually, it takes 1–2 working days). MyWed editors can decline your portfolio by deleting all or any photos if they do not comply with the MyWed Terms, do not correspond to the category they are uploaded to, or if your level of visual and technical skills is not high enough."
msgstr "是的，我們會這麼做。所有的新攝影師都必須接受審核（這通常需要1-2個工作天）。如果照片不符合MyWed規範、與上傳的類別不符，或是您的視覺和技術技能水準未達標準，MyWed編輯擁有權力能夠透過刪除所有或任何照片拒絕作品集。"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:21
msgid "What photos can I upload?"
msgstr "我能夠上傳哪些照片？"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:22
#, php-format
msgid "Please, upload photos corresponding to the following categories only: %s. Upload the photos only to the categories they comply with. Please note, we estimate the compliance based on the subject depicted in the photo. If you took a person's portrait at the wedding, you are not supposed to upload the photo to the Wedding category but you can upload it to the Portrait category."
msgstr "請只上傳與以下類別相應的照片：%s。只上傳與類別相符的照片。請注意，我們會根據照片描繪的主題來評估合規性。如果在婚禮上拍攝人物肖像，您不應將照片上傳至「婚禮」類別，但是您可以將它上傳到「肖像」類別。"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:23
msgid "Can I upload collages, album layouts or other images with design elements?"
msgstr "我可以上傳拼貼、相簿版面或是其他帶設計元素的圖像嗎？"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:24
msgid "Nope. Collages, diptychs, triptychs as well as photomontage and digital effects are not allowed. <br> Also we don’t like photos with excessive quantity of design elements or added in design objects, <br> borders, texts, huge watermarks or logos. Pure photos are awesome – don’t you think?"
msgstr "不可以。拼貼、雙聯畫、三幅一聯圖以及蒙太奇照片和電腦特效都是禁止的。我們也不喜歡帶有大量設計元素的照片或是添加設計的物件、邊框、文字、大水印或圖標。純粹的照片非常棒─您不這麼想嗎？"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:25
msgid "Other forbidden types of photos"
msgstr "其他禁止照片類型"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:26
msgid "Photos that show images of pornography or have visual content of offensive, <br> slanderous or extremist nature are also not allowed."
msgstr "內含色情內容的照片，或是帶有攻擊性、誹謗或極端主義的視覺內容皆被禁止。"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:27
#: application/views/scripts/translations/category.phtml:202
msgid "Can I upload photos from workshops or staged events?"
msgstr "我可以上傳來自工作坊與舞台活動的照片嗎？"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:28
msgid "Photos taken at workshops and staged events are not allowed, even if you were a speaker there."
msgstr "禁止使用來自工作坊與舞台活動的照片，即使您是活動發言人也不行。"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:29
msgid "Can I upload photos taken by another photographer?"
msgstr "我可以上傳其他攝影師拍的照片嗎？"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:30
msgid "We think that another photographer won’t be particularly happy about it. <br> You can only upload photos that you took yourself. Also don’t forget about the rights of the people in your shots."
msgstr "我們認為其他攝影師對此並不會感到開心。<br>您只能上傳自己拍攝的照片。另外也別忘了照片中人物的權利。"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:31
#: application/views/scripts/translations/category.phtml:203
msgid "How is the rating of photos and series calculated?"
msgstr "如何計算照片和系列的評等？"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:32
msgid "The rating of a photo depends on the number of likes. However, not all likes are equally effective. The higher the rating of a photographer who liked the photo, the more rating the like adds to the photo. Photos and series with the biggest number of likes are awarded the Best of the Week flag. Rating gradually decreases, and the yellow flag may disappear over time. The higher was the rating of a photo or a series, the longer it keeps the yellow flag."
msgstr "照片的評等取決於按讚數。不過，並不是所有按讚數都同樣有效。對照片按讚的攝影師評等愈高，該讚數加入照片的評等就愈多。按讚數最多的照片和系列將被賦予「本週最佳」的標章。評等會逐漸下降，黃色的標章將隨時間推移而消失。照片或系列的評等愈高，黃色標章的保留時間就愈長。"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:33
msgid "What photos are awarded the Editors' Choice flags?"
msgstr "什麼樣的照片會被賦予「編輯精選」標章？"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:34
msgid "The Editors' Choice red flags are given to photos liked by our editors and at their own discretion. Those are just the photos we take a liking to and would like to attract your attention to. Our opinion and taste sense may not conform with yours, and we do not consider our choice the only right. Please note that our editors guarantee to look through works of the MyWed Pro users only. The rest of the photos is revised as far as possible."
msgstr "「編輯精選」紅色標章會被賦予在我們的編輯自行決定並按讚的照片上。那是我們喜愛，並且希望能夠吸引您注意力的照片。我們的觀點和品味可能與您不同，而我們並不認為我們的選擇是唯一正解。<br>請注意，我們的編輯只保證會瀏覽MyWed Pro用戶的作品。其餘照片將盡可能進行修訂。"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:35
msgid "How is the rating of photographers calculated?"
msgstr "攝影師評等如何計算？"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:36
#, php-format
msgid "In general, a photographers' rating in each category consists of the rating of their %1$s best photos and %2$s best series in the category. The fresher the photo or the series, the more rating it adds to the photographer's rating. Photos and series with the Editors' Choice flag, and achievements in the MyWed Award annual contests contribute to the rating as well. Rating in each category is calculated separately. It means that a photographer's rating in the Wedding category does not influence their rating in the Kids category. Besides, the number of followers adds points to the photographer's rating, too."
msgstr "通常來說，攝影師在每個類別中的評等源於其%1$s張最佳照片以及%2$s組最佳系列。照片或系列愈新，加入攝影師的評等就愈多。具備「編輯精選」標章的照片和系列，以及獲得MyWed Award年度競賽獎項也對評等有所幫助。每個類別的評等都是分開計算的。這代表攝影師在婚禮類別的評等並不會影響其在兒童類別的評等。另外，粉絲數也能為攝影師評等加分。"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:37
msgid "What actions do you consider as rating cheat?"
msgstr "你們如何判定評等詐欺？"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:38
msgid "Any obvious or hidden calls to like or to take a look at the photo or profile will be considered as a rating cheat. They include, for example, such comments or messages as \"Hey, great shots! Just rated them!\", etc. Moreover, if you like photos with the only purpose of receiving mutual likes, we also consider it as a rating cheat. In brief, if you do anything on the website to get more rating instead of just having pleasure, please don't."
msgstr "任何呼籲對照片或個人檔案按讚或瀏覽的明示或暗示都將視為欺瞞評等系統。舉例來說，這包括「嘿，好照片！剛為他們評分！」等等的留言或訊息。此外，如果您只出於互讚的目的而對照片按讚，我們也將此視為欺瞞評等系統。簡而言之，除了獲得樂趣，如果您想在網站上進行任何獲取更多評等的動作，請不要這麼做。"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:39
msgid "Can I use MyWed personal messages for goods and services advertising?"
msgstr "我可以使用MyWed個人訊息傳送產品與服務廣告嗎？"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:40
#, php-format
msgid "Nope, you are not allowed to do so, otherwise, we remove your profile without notification. If you would like to promote your goods in the photographers' community, please email us to %s and we will find an appropriate collaboration option."
msgstr "不，您不可以這麼做，否則，我們將移除您的個人檔案，恕不另行通知。如果想要在攝影師社群中宣傳您的商品，請寄送電子郵件至 %s，我們將找出合適的合作選項。"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:41
msgid "Rights"
msgstr "權利"

#: application/views/scripts/rules/index.phtml:42
#, php-format
msgid "MyWed is not an owner of uploaded photos. Photographers upload their photos willingly and retain all rights to them. <br> If you want to use some of the photos uploaded to MyWed, please ask permission from their owner first. <br> If you found out that your photos had been uploaded to MyWed illegally and you are the owner of all rights to those photos, <br> please, contact us at <a href=\"mailto:%1$s\">%1$s</a>"
msgstr "MyWed不是上傳照片的擁有者。攝影師自願上傳他們的照片並保留自身權利。<br>如果您想要使用上傳至MyWed的照片，請先尋求擁有人的許可。<br>如果您發現您的照片被非法上傳至MyWed，而您是那些照片所有權的擁有者，敬請使用<a href=\"mailto:%1$s\">%1$s</a>聯繫我們。"

