#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:3
msgid "Are you photogenic?"
msgstr "您上相嗎？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:4
msgid "What are the most important components of a good photo in your opinion?"
msgstr "您認為一張好照片裡最重要的元素有哪些？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:5
msgid "Do you love traveling?"
msgstr "您熱愛旅行嗎？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:6
msgid "What do you like most about your profession?"
msgstr "您最喜歡這個職業的哪個部分？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:7
msgid "What do you like least about your profession?"
msgstr "您最不喜歡這個職業的哪個部分？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:8
msgid "How do you handle criticism?"
msgstr "您如何應對批評？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:9
msgid "What things are to be avoided when shooting?"
msgstr "拍攝時應該避免哪些事項？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:10
msgid "What influences the value of a photo? What are its elements?"
msgstr "什麼事物會影響照片的價值？它包含了哪些因素？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:11
msgid "What person can be the symbol of the 21st century in your opinion?"
msgstr "您認為哪個人可以被視為21世紀的代表人物？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:12
msgid "Who do you want to shoot?"
msgstr "您想拍誰？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:13
msgid "Do you have any professional taboos?"
msgstr "您有任何職業禁忌嗎？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:14
msgid "Who would you like to shoot with?"
msgstr "您想和誰一起拍攝？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:15
msgid "What do you worry about, and why?"
msgstr "您會擔心什麼？為什麼？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:16
msgid "What is the most impressive moment in your life?"
msgstr "您人生中印象最深刻的一刻是什麼？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:17
msgid "If you were a cartoon, book or movie character, who would you be and why?"
msgstr "如果您是個卡通、小說或電影角色，您想成為誰？為什麼？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:18
msgid "Who inspires you in your life and why?"
msgstr "誰能在生命中激發您的靈感？為什麼？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:19
msgid "How do you define success? How do you measure it?"
msgstr "您如何定義成功？您會怎麼衡量它？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:20
msgid "Would you rather be liked or respected?"
msgstr "您是希望被喜愛或是被景仰呢？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:21
msgid "What is the biggest mistake you have ever made at work?"
msgstr "您在工作上犯過最大的錯誤是什麼？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:22
msgid "When you're going to travel, what do you take with you and why?"
msgstr "當您要去旅行時，您會帶什麼？為什麼？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:23
msgid "Is there anything that you wish you hadn't bought among the gadgets that you own? Why?"
msgstr "在您擁有的物品中，有任何您希望沒買過的嗎？為什麼？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:24
msgid "How do you educate yourself to take better pictures?"
msgstr "您如何學習拍出更好的照片呢？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:25
msgid "What is the one thing you wish you knew when you started taking photos?"
msgstr "哪件事是您希望從開始拍照時就知道的？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:26
msgid "What do you want to say with your photographs?"
msgstr "您想用自己的照片說些什麼？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:27
msgid "What motivates you to continue taking pictures?"
msgstr "讓您持續拍照的動力是什麼？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:28
msgid "Should your parents have been more or less strict?"
msgstr "您的雙親應該更加或是更不嚴厲呢？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:29
msgid "If you could go back in time, what would you do differently?"
msgstr "如果能回到過去，您會有什麼不同舉動呢？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:30
msgid "What about life on other planets?"
msgstr "您對在其他星球上的生命有什麼看法呢？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:31
msgid "Who are your heroes?"
msgstr "誰是您的英雄？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:32
msgid "Who do you have no respect for?"
msgstr "您不重視誰？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:33
msgid "What do you do in your spare time?"
msgstr "您空閒時會做些什麼？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:34
msgid "What's the side of you that the public never sees?"
msgstr "您的哪一面是公眾不曾看到過的？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:35
msgid "When are you completely satisfied with your work?"
msgstr "您什麼時候會對自己的作品完全滿意？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:36
msgid "Do you believe in the traditional roles for men and women?"
msgstr "您認可男女性的傳統角色嗎？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:37
msgid "Do you make friends easily?"
msgstr "您容易交到朋友嗎？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:38
msgid "Where would you like to live?"
msgstr "您希望在哪裡生活？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:39
msgid "What's the stupidest thing you've ever agreed to do?"
msgstr "您曾同意嘗試過最愚蠢的事是什麼？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:40
msgid "Is there life after marriage?"
msgstr "結婚後還有人生嗎？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:41
msgid "Do you have a favorite joke? Tell us."
msgstr "您有最愛的笑話嗎？請告訴我們。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:42
msgid "Do you like dogs or cats?"
msgstr "您喜歡狗還是貓？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:43
msgid "Who or what do you hate?"
msgstr "您討厭誰或什麼？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:44
msgid "The best thing in life is:"
msgstr "人生中最棒的事是："

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:45
msgid "The most annoying thing in life is:"
msgstr "人生中最煩人的事是："

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:46
msgid "Is there anything around you that you would like to change?"
msgstr "您的周圍有任何您想改變的事情嗎？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:47
msgid "What would you like to change in yourself?"
msgstr "您希望改變自己的哪一點？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:48
msgid "What would you like to change in the world?"
msgstr "您希望改變世界的哪些方面？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:49
msgid "If aliens come to the Earth and you are the first person they meet, what will you tell them?"
msgstr "如果外星人來到地球，而您是他們第一個遇見的人，您會跟他們說什麼？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:50
msgid "If you are called to shoot a movie, what genre will it be?"
msgstr "如果您被邀請去拍攝電影，那會是什麼類型的電影呢？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:51
msgid "Tomorrow I will go and do..."
msgstr "明天我會去做..."

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:52
msgid "First and foremost – whom can you name as the best photographer in your city? :)"
msgstr "首先─您認為誰是您所在城市中最優秀的攝影師呢？ :)"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:53
#, php-format
msgid "First and foremost – whom can you name as the best photographer in %s? :)"
msgstr "首先─您認為誰是%s最優秀的攝影師呢？ :)"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:54
msgid "How did you get in the photography industry?"
msgstr "您如何開始從事攝影行業？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:55
msgid "What will be the future of photography?"
msgstr "攝影的前景如何？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:56
msgid "What is special in the photography genre you specialise at?"
msgstr "您擅長的攝影類型有什麼特別之處？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:57
msgid "Are there any trends in photography?"
msgstr "攝影有什麼潮流？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:58
msgid "What should be the criteria for a customer to choose a photographer?"
msgstr "客戶選擇攝影師的標準有哪些？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:59
msgid "What details that usually pass unnoticed can a photographer notice?"
msgstr "通常不會被注意，但攝影師卻能留意的細節有哪些呢？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:60
msgid "Whose work has influenced you most as a photographer?"
msgstr "身為攝影師，誰的作品對您影響最大？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/interview_questions.phtml:61
msgid "Can you give a few tips for photographers who are just starting out?"
msgstr "您能為新進攝影師提供一些建議嗎？"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:3
msgid "Viviana Calaón Moscova"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:4
msgid "Viviana Calaón Moscova was born in Buenos Aires. She is dedicated to the wedding, family, and documentary photography in Ecuador. Viviana is recognized by some of the most important Family Photography Associations in the world: The best Ecuadorian family photographer and Top 50 family photographers in the world on MyWed and also award-winning at Fearless Family Photographers. Her greatest passion and goal is to connect with people, she tells stories with soul, full of real and spontaneous moments with high emotional impact."
msgstr "Viviana Calaón Moscova出生於布宜諾斯艾利斯。她在厄瓜多致力於婚禮、家庭和紀實攝影。Viviana受到全球家庭攝影協會的一些重要獎項肯定：MyWed厄瓜多最佳家庭攝影師以及全球前50名家庭攝影師，同時還榮獲Fearless Family Photographers獎項。她最大的熱情和目標就是與人們聯繫，她用靈魂訴說故事，內容充滿真實和自發的時刻，並且具有強烈的情感影響。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:6
msgid "Olivier Bolte"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:7
msgid "Life is all about movement, colors, emotions, and carelessness…that's what Olivier is trying to communicate in his family pictures. Number 1 by Lifestyle Photographers in 2020, the best 2020 This is Reportage Family french storyteller, and Fearless Family awarded photographer, Olivier always tries to capture happy emotions, humor, and beauty in his family or pregnancy lifestyle shoots or in his documentary family sessions. Kids have become an endless source of inspiration since he started to photograph them 7 years ago. Father of 2 little guys, he knows how those monsters work."
msgstr "生活就是運動、顏色、情感和輕鬆自在…這些是Olivier想在其家庭照片中傳達的訊息。身為2020年生活方式攝影師的第一名，2020年This is Reportage: Family最優秀的法國說故事家，以及Fearless Family的獲獎攝影師，Olivier一向試著在家庭、孕期生活方式拍攝，或是紀實家庭攝影中捕捉快樂的情緒、幽默和美麗。自從7年前開始為孩子拍照以來，他們就成為了其無窮無盡的靈感來源。做為兩個孩子的父親，他知道這些小怪獸們的行為模式。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:9
msgid "Theo Manusaride"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:10
msgid "With 13 years of experience as a professional photographer, Theo's commitment to documentary photography was rewarded by some of the most respected photography communities like Fearless Photographers, Fearless Family Photographers, This is Reportage and This is Reportage: Family, that also ranked her Top 30 documentary family photographers in the world and Top 5 in the Netherlands in 2020. In life, as well as in photography, she believes in honesty, supports authenticity, and strives for meaningfulness. She also believes that family photography shouldn't be a luxury and that every kid deserves meaningful memories of his childhood."
msgstr "憑藉13年做為專業攝影師的經驗，Theo對紀實攝影的奉獻獲得一些最受尊敬的攝影社群認可，例如Fearless Photographers、Fearless Family Photographers、This is Reportage以及This is Reportage: Family，這也讓她獲得全球前30名紀實家庭攝影師，以及2020年荷蘭前5名的排名。在生活（以及攝影）中，她相信誠信，支持真實性，並努力追求意義。她也深信家庭攝影不該是奢侈品，而每個孩子都值得擁有有意義的童年回憶。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:13
msgid "Kristof is recognized by various photography associations: he was ranked Top 10 family photographer by Inspiration Photographers and Top 10 family storyteller by This Is Reportage in 2020, and Top 10 family photographer by Fearless Photographers in 2021. He is the best Belgian photographer on MyWed and a jury member at This Is Reportage: Family in 2020. Kristof prefers documentary photography and tries to find beauty in ordinary things."
msgstr "Kristof獲得許多攝影協會的認可： Inspiration Photographers前10名家庭攝影師、2020年This Is Reportage前10名家庭說故事家，以及2021年Fearless Photographers前10名家庭攝影師。他是MyWed的最佳比利時攝影師，並在2020年擔任This Is Reportage: Family的評審。Kristof偏愛紀實攝影，並且嘗試尋找日常點滴之美。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:15
msgid "Evelen Torrens"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:16
msgid "Evelen Torrens started photographing professionally after the birth of her twin sons, Fernando and Miguel, who transformed her way of seeing and living life. With just 4 years of photography, Evelen was titled Family Photographer of the Year 2019 and the Most Awarded Family Photographer 2019 by Inspiration Photographers with 48 photographs in a single year - a new record for the entire association. Dedicated exclusively to family photography, Evelen brings a sensitive and insightful documentary look at small great moments of life, seeking simplicity and objectivity in family photographs. Her approach bases on respect for sentiment, truth, and responsibility for the importance that those records will have over the years."
msgstr "Evelen Torrens在Fernando和Miguel這對雙胞胎兒子出生後開始從事職業攝影，而他們改變了她看待和過生活的方式。僅僅經過四年的攝影生涯，Evelen就被評選為2019年的年度家庭攝影師，並且以單年度48張照片作品的成績成為2019年Inspiration Photographers獲獎最多的家庭攝影師——這是整個協會的新紀錄。Evelen特別專注於家庭攝影，以敏感而富有洞察力的紀實視角記錄生活中微小而美好的時刻，在家庭照片中尋求簡單和客觀性。她的態度奠基於對情感、真實的尊重，以及這些紀錄多年來抱持重要性的責任感。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:18
msgid "Katrin Küllenberg"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:19
msgid "Katrin is a long-time family photographer and has been titled Top 1 Storyteller and Top 1 Photographer in Germany by This Is Reportage Family in 2020, and Top 1 Photographer in Europe in 2020 by FPJA. In her photos, she always looks for the special in the ordinary. She loves to play with light, color, and lines and shows her clients the drama and love in their daily family life."
msgstr "Katrin是位長期的家庭攝影師，曾被評選為2020年This Is Reportage Family的第一名說故事家和第一名德國攝影師，以及2020年FPJA的第一名歐洲攝影師。在照片中，她總是在平凡中尋找特別事物。她熱愛玩轉光線、顏色和線條，向客戶們展示日常家庭生活中的戲劇感和愛。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:21
msgid "Marisa Martins"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:22
msgid "I was born and raised near Lisbon, Portugal, and settled in the world of professional photography after several returns in my life — always good, always rich in experiences, and inspiring people. I went through the fashion area, worked as a model, and traveled across the world before I was twenty. Then I graduated from the university as a civil engineer and worked several years in project management. Only when my daughter Clara was born in 2012, I allowed myself to look for new horizons and found my greatest passion in family photography. Today, I wouldn't trade this life and my Canons for any other profession. Shooting the Day in the Life photo sessions, I try to gather more than images, I capture sensations closer to the experience of everyday life, I encapsulate memories, coated with feeling. This approach changes everything about family photography: it adds value to life, has a photographic record that guarantees feelings of happiness that we all can identify aesthetically and emotionally. Shooting the documentary family photography, I look for photographs that reflect life in a raw, more real, less peaceful, and less perfect way, approaching the real memories of childhood, contributing to everyday awareness of how incredible and interesting an imperfect family is."
msgstr "我在葡萄牙的里斯本附近出生長大，並在人生中的幾次轉折後認定了職業攝影界——經驗一向是好的，總是很豐富，而且很鼓舞人心。20歲之前，我曾踏入時尚界、當過模特兒並在世界各國遊歷。接著我以土木工程師的身份從大學畢業，從事了幾年的專案管理。直到我的女兒Clara在2012年出生，我才允許自己尋找新的視野，並發現自己對家庭攝影最有熱情。現在，我不會把這樣的生活和我所有的Canon相機拿來與其他任何職業交換。拍攝「生活中的一天」（Day in the Life）照片時，我試著收集的不僅僅是圖像，我會捕捉更接近日常生活體驗的情感，我想用感受覆蓋並封裝回憶。這個方法完全改變了家庭攝影：它為生活增添了價值，擁有的攝影紀錄保證我們全都可以從美學及情感上辨認幸福的感覺。拍攝紀實家庭攝影時，我想尋求能夠透過坦率、更加真實、不那麼和平與完美的方式來反映生活的照片，接近童年的真實回憶，讓人們能夠意識到不完美家庭是多麼迷人而有趣。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:24
msgid "Adam Riley"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/jury.phtml:25
msgid "Hey, I'm Adam! I used to be a forensic scientist, but after falling in love with photography + storytelling, I left the scientific world and began my photographic career. Ten years later, I still love it! Father of two amazing little boys, Noah (7) and Lev (4), and husband to Laura! We love camping, cooking, cinema trips, and walking our labradoodle Quorra. It's a cliché, but it seems like only last week Noah was crawling around, only yesterday that Lev was born! Laura and I are keenly aware of time whirling past us and make every effort to savor the boys as they grow. I try to capture this daily growth for us to review in years to come, and I am rarely without a camera. I love to do the same for other families with my documentary portrait sessions."
msgstr "嗨，我是Adam！我曾是位法醫科學家，但在愛上攝影+說故事後，我離開了科學界並開啟了攝影生涯。10年後，我依然很愛它！我是Noah（7歲）和Lev（4歲）這兩個了不起男孩的父親，也是Laura的丈夫！我們熱愛露營、烹飪、看電影以及遛我們的拉布拉多犬Quorra。這聽起來是陳腔濫調，但我感覺Noah似乎上星期還在到處爬，而Lev像是昨天才剛出生！我和Laura對時間飛逝而過非常有感，並盡一切努力細品男孩們的成長過程。我試著捕捉這些能讓我們在未來幾年回顧的日常成長時刻，所以我很少沒帶著相機。我也很喜愛透過紀實肖像拍攝為其他家庭做相同的事。"

