#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:405
msgid "Set your phone number in order to create topics"
msgstr "請設定您的電話號碼以建立主題"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:407
msgid "Set your phone number in order to continue to send messages"
msgstr "請設定您的電話號碼以繼續寄送訊息"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:410
msgid "Please set your phone number to like a photo"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:411
msgid "To upload a photo shoot, please set your phone number"
msgstr "為了能夠上傳拍攝，請先設定您的電話號碼"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:412
msgid "We believe that in the next year the world will return to its routine course."
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:413
msgid "It will be displayed on the website so that brides can call you. You will also be able to use it to reset your password."
msgstr "電話號碼將顯示在網站上，以便新娘聯繫。您也可以使用它來重設密碼。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:416
msgid "The link to your MyWed portfolio contains rel=\"nofollow\" or rel=\"noindex\", and our system doesn't accept these tags. Please remove the tag by editing the link on your website."
msgstr "導向您MyWed作品集的連結包含rel=\"nofollow\"或是rel=\"noindex\"，但我們的系統不接受這些標記。請在您的網站上編輯連結，移除標記。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:417
msgid "The winner of the main nomination 'The Best Series of Photos' will become the owner of the latest Nikon Z7 camera complete with the NIKKOR Z 24-70mm f/2.8 S lens."
msgstr "主要提名「最佳照片系列」的贏家將獲得最新的Nikon Z7相機，並配備NIKKOR Z 24-70mm f/2.8 S鏡頭。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:418
msgid "Besides, this year we have a new prize for the winner of the \"Best Wedding Story\" nomination. The Photographer of the Year will take the Nikon Z7 camera with Nikkor Z 24-70mm f/2.8 S lens!"
msgstr "此外，我們今年為「最佳婚禮故事」提名得主準備了新獎品。年度攝影師將能獲得Nikon Z7相機以及Nikkor Z 24-70mm f/2.8 S鏡頭！"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:419
msgid "Your profile passes the moderation"
msgstr "您的個人檔案正在審核中"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:420
msgid "You can't unblock additional specialities until the moderation is complete. Please be patient. Usually, it takes a couple of days.<br><br>We will notify you about the moderation results soon."
msgstr "在審核完成之前，您無法解鎖其他專長。請耐心等候。審核通常會在幾天內完成。<br><br>我們會盡快通知您審核結果。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:425
msgid "Fabulous photos and series by wedding and family photographers"
msgstr "由婚禮與家庭攝影師拍攝的絕妙照片和系列"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:430
msgid "We are confident that this year the quarantine will end and the world will return to its routine course."
msgstr "今年，隔離狀態將結束，而世界會回到常軌，我們對此很有信心。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:432
#, php-format
msgid "Your opinion is important to us. <br>Was the top list of %s useful to you?"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:433
#, php-format
msgid "Evaluation of our top list <br>of %s:"
msgstr ""

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:436
msgid "Multiple exposure"
msgstr "多重曝光"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:438
msgid "We consider multiple exposure photos to be separate shots regardless of whether it was made in-camera or in a photo editor."
msgstr "我們認為多重曝光的照片都是個別拍攝，不論其透過相機或是編輯軟體完成。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:440
msgid "Collage or photomontage"
msgstr "拼貼或蒙太奇"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:442
msgid "Compiling several photos or their parts in one picture is not welcome."
msgstr "不接受將多張照片或他們的其他部分匯集成一張照片。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:444
msgid "A diptych or a triptych"
msgstr "雙聯畫或三聯畫"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:446
msgid "Several shots inside one image. Please upload each photo separately."
msgstr "一張圖像中存在多張照片。請分別上傳每張照片。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:448
msgid "Reuploading"
msgstr "重新上傳"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:450
msgid "It seems the uploaded photo is similar or identical to a photo you uploaded before. Reuploading the same photos is not welcome."
msgstr "上傳的照片似乎與之前上傳過的照片相似或相同。不接受重新上傳相同的照片。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:452
msgid "Photos are taken at different events"
msgstr "照片拍攝自不同活動"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:454
msgid "Series should consist of photos taken at the same photo shoot. Photos taken on different days are allowed only if they are linked by chronology, and have the same conceptual idea or participants."
msgstr "系列中的照片應由同一次拍攝組成。不接受在不同日期拍攝的照片，除非其與發生順序有關聯，並且擁有相同的概念或參與人員。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:456
msgid "Low technical quality of the photo, poor composition, cropping, or conceptual idea. Please submit only the best photos."
msgstr "照片技術品質過低，構圖、裁切或概念不佳。請只繳交最佳照片。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:458
msgid "The photos are identical or too similar. The pictures feature repetitive subjects, poses, locations, situations, etc."
msgstr "照片相同或過於相似。照片具有重複主題、姿勢、地點、情況等等。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:460
msgid "Photos from workshops (even if you are the host) are not accepted."
msgstr "不接受來自工作坊的照片（即使您是主持人）。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:462
msgid "Contact details in the profile description"
msgstr "個人檔案描述中的聯絡資訊"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:464
msgid "You have set contact details in your profile description. Please remove them from the section."
msgstr "您已在個人檔案描述中設定聯絡資訊。請從該區塊中移除他們。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:466
msgid "Incorrect country"
msgstr "國家不正確"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:468
msgid "The country set in your profile has to correspond to the country code of your phone number and your current location."
msgstr "個人檔案中設定的國家必須與電話國碼以及目前位置相符。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:470
msgid "Unavailable website"
msgstr "網站不可用"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:472
msgid "Unfortunately, at the moment of our test, your website was unavailable. Please check whether it works normally and if the address specified correctly."
msgstr "遺憾的是，您的網站在我們測試時無法使用。請檢查其是否正常運作，以及網址是否正確。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:474
msgid "Suspicious profile"
msgstr "可疑的個人檔案"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:476
msgid "Your profile seems suspicious. Probably, you have specified incomplete or wrong personal info."
msgstr "您的個人檔案看起來很可疑。也許您輸入了不完整或錯誤的個人資訊。"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:478
msgid "Studio profile"
msgstr "工作室檔案"

#: application/views/scripts/translations/notused.phtml:480
msgid "The profile holds a studio name or features works of several people. Please note that only personal profiles are allowed on MyWed."
msgstr "個人檔案包含工作室名稱或是具備多人作品。請注意，MyWed只接受個人檔案。"

